| Mapa SSOT mínimo | `specs/foundation/minimal-ssot.md` |
| Paths e convenções | `specs/foundation/path-conventions.md` |
| Fluxo de desenvolvimento | `specs/foundation/development-workflow.md` |
| DoR / DoD | `specs/foundation/definition-of-ready.md`, `definition-of-done.md` |
| Padrões de código | `docs/implementation/` |
| Arquitetura | `docs/architecture/` |
| Schema Oracle | `database/` |
| Governança documental | `docs/governance/07-documentation-architecture.md` |

**Conflito:** prevalece `specs/` sobre `docs/` sobre código.

